<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>ISRO Starry Night Theme</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #0b0c2a, #000000 70%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, #1a1a40, #000000 70%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 50% 80%, #2c2c54, #000000 70%);
      background-blend-mode: screen;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      position: relative;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .aurora {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 40%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,255,200,0.2), rgba(0,100,255,0.2), rgba(255,0,200,0.2));
      filter: blur(60px);
      animation: auroraMove 10s infinite alternate;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    @keyframes auroraMove {
      from { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); }
      to   { transform: translateY(-30px) translateX(30px); }
    }

    .star {
      position: absolute;
      width: 4px;
      height: 4px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: twinkle 2s infinite alternate;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    @keyframes twinkle {
      from { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.8); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); }
    }

    .shooting-star {
      position: absolute;
      width: 2px;
      height: 80px;
      background: linear-gradient(white, transparent);
      animation: shoot 3s linear infinite;
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      z-index: 0;
    }
    @keyframes shoot {
      from { transform: translateX(0) translateY(0) rotate(45deg); opacity: 1; }
      to   { transform: translateX(300px) translateY(-300px) rotate(45deg); opacity: 0; }
    }

    .planet {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(20px);
      opacity: 0.3;
      z-index: 0;
      animation: drift 60s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes drift {
      from { transform: translateX(0); }
      to   { transform: translateX(200px); }
    }

    .hamburger span {
      display: block;
      width: 25px;
      height: 3px;
      margin: 4px 0;
      background-color: #fff;
    }
    .dropdown-menu {
      background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
      border: 1px solid #00d9ff;
    }
    .dropdown-menu .dropdown-item {
      color: #fff;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .dropdown-menu .dropdown-item:hover {
      color: #00d9ff;
      background-color: transparent;
    }
    .content {
      margin-top: 120px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1; /* keep text above background effects */
    }
    hr {
      border: 1px solid #00d9ff;
      width: 60%;
      margin: 20px auto;
    }

    /* Emoji with orbit path */
    .emoji-container {
      display: inline-block;
      position: relative;
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
    .emoji-display {
      font-size: 4.5rem;
      animation: bounce 1s infinite alternate;
      position: relative;
      top: 10px;
      transform: rotate(-8deg);
    }
    @keyframes bounce {
      from { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-8deg); }
      to   { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(-8deg); }
    }
    .orbit {
      position: absolute;
      top: -20px;
      left: -20px;
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(0,217,255,0.5);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: orbitSpin 8s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes orbitSpin {
      from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      to   { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    .section {
      padding: 60px 20px;
      z-index: 1;
      position: relative;
    }
    .card {
      background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border: 1px solid #00d9ff;
      color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="aurora"></div>

  <!-- Stars sprinkled -->
  <div class="star" style="top:10%; left:15%;"></div>
  <div class="star" style="top:25%; left:70%;"></div>
  <div class="star" style="top:40%; left:50%;"></div>
  <div class="star" style="top:60%; left:20%;"></div>
  <div class="star" style="top:75%; left:80%;"></div>
  <div class="star" style="top:85%; left:35%;"></div>

  <div class="shooting-star" style="top:20%; left:10%;"></div>
  <div class="shooting-star" style="top:50%; left:30%; animation-delay:1.5s;"></div>

  <div class="planet" style="top:30%; left:10%; width:120px; height:120px; background:#3498db;"></div>
  <div class="planet" style="top:70%; left:60%; width:180px; height:180px; background:#e67e22; animation-delay:20s;"></div>
  <div class="planet" style="top:50%; left:80%; width:100px; height:100px; background:#9b59b6; animation-delay:40s;"></div>

  <div class="dropdown position-fixed top-0 start-0 m-3">
    <button class="btn" type="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
      <div class="hamburger">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </div>
    </button>
    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
      <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="#home">Home</a></li>
      <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="#about">About ISRO</a></li>
      <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="#missions">Missions</a></li>
      <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="#achievements">Achievements</a></li>
      <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="container content" id="home">
    <h1>
      Welcome to ISRO 🌌
    <span class="emoji-container">
  <span class="emoji-display">🚀 👨‍🚀</span>
</span>

    </h1>
    <hr>
    <p>India’s pride in space exploration — advancing science, technology, and innovation for the nation and the world.</p>
  </div>

  <div id="about" class="section container text-center">
    <h2>About ISRO</h2>
    <hr>
    <p>The Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO) is India’s national space agency, founded in 1969. It has played a pivotal role in satellite launches, planetary exploration, and advancing space technology for societal benefit.</p>
  </div>

  <div id="missions" class="section container">
    <h2 class="text-center">Major Missions</h2>
    <hr>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card p-3">
          <h5>Chandrayaan</h5>
          <p>India’s lunar missions exploring the Moon’s surface and resources.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card p-3">
          <h5>Mangalyaan</h5>
          <p>The Mars Orbiter Mission — India’s first interplanetary mission, launched in 2013.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card p-3">
          <h5>Gaganyaan</h5>
          <p>India’s upcoming human spaceflight program to send astronauts into orbit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="achievements" class="section container text-center">
    <h2>Achievements</h2>
    <hr>
    <p>ISRO has successfully launched hundreds of satellites, developed indigenous launch vehicles like PSLV and GSLV, and positioned India as a global leader in affordable space technology.</p>
  </div>

  <div id="contact" class="section container text-center">
    <h2>Contact ISRO</h2>
    <hr>
    <p>📧 info@isro.gov.in | ☎ +91 80 2217 2222</p>
    <p>ISRO Headquarters, Bengaluru, India</p>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
